<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="676542"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1804639242"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ビードロ模様"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="やなぎなぎ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ビードロ模様"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:52.430"><div begin="00:30.790" end="04:10.220"><p begin="00:30.790" end="00:32.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">探していた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我总在寻找喜欢上你的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">saga xi te yi ta su ki ni na lu li yuwu o</span></p><p begin="00:32.560" end="00:36.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">好きになる理由を</p><p begin="00:36.660" end="00:45.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">もっともらしい言葉だとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">譬如尤为合理的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo to mo la xi yi koto ba da to ka</span></p><p begin="00:45.410" end="00:47.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">気づいたとき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉时 思绪的线已纠结缠绵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu yi ta toki yito wa mocu le a te</span></p><p begin="00:47.360" end="00:51.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">糸は縺れ合って</p><p begin="00:51.440" end="01:00.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">固結びがひどくなってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剪不断 理还乱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kata musu bi ga hi do ku na te ta</span></p><p begin="01:00.240" end="01:07.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">躊躇わないで言えたのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若毫不犹豫地吐露心声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tamela wa na yi de yi e ta no na la</span></p><p begin="01:07.320" end="01:14.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">君はもう泣かないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你便不会再哭吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi wa mo wu na ka na yi no</span></p><p begin="01:14.000" end="01:15.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">雲の形<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描述思念的冲动 穿透层层云雾</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kumo no kataqi cu ki nu ke lu omo yi no xiyou dou ega ku</span></p><p begin="01:15.750" end="01:20.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">突き抜ける想いの衝動描く<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kumo no kataqi cu ki nu ke lu omo yi no xiyou dou ega ku</span></p><p begin="01:20.070" end="01:24.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">漂う真夏の香りに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让人无数次回想起盛夏飘逸的芬芳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tadayo wu ma nacu no kao li ni nan do mo omo yi de xi te lu</span></p><p begin="01:24.930" end="01:28.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">何度も思い出してる</p><p begin="01:28.660" end="01:32.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">誰か触れた軌跡だけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁触碰过的轨迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dale ka fu le ta ki seki da ke</span></p><p begin="01:32.300" end="01:34.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">夕立のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">犹如雷阵雨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yuwu daqi no yo wu ni</span></p><p begin="01:34.660" end="01:45.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">ぽつりと色が染みだしていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点滴渲染黄昏的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po cu li to yilo ga xi mi da xi te yi ta</span></p><p begin="01:51.470" end="01:57.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">レンズ越しに眺めてた世界は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眺望镜头映入眼帘的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">le n zu ko xi ni naga me te ta se kai wa</span></p><p begin="01:57.250" end="02:05.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">他人事のように映り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛与己无关</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta nin goto no yo wu ni wucu li</span></p><p begin="02:05.930" end="02:07.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">失くしていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当重拾丢失的心情之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku xi te yi ta ki mo qi o xi ta toki</span></p><p begin="02:07.860" end="02:11.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">気持ちを知った時</p><p begin="02:11.880" end="02:20.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">僕らの時間 動き出した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的时间开始流动了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">boku la no ji kan wugo ki da xi ta</span></p><p begin="02:20.690" end="02:27.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">秤にかける恋の質量<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天平上两人恋爱的质量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hakali ni ka ke lu koyi no xicu liyou</span></p><p begin="02:27.920" end="02:34.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">どうしたって釣り合わない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎样称也无法让其平衡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do wu xi ta te cu li a wa na yi</span></p><p begin="02:34.430" end="02:38.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">空の形 焼き付ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把这片天空铭刻瞳中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sola no kataqi ya ki cu ke lu</span></p><p begin="02:38.140" end="02:40.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">銀の向こうまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到银河尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gin no mu ko wu ma de</span></p><p begin="02:40.680" end="02:45.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">日差しの眩しさ 温度も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一丝阳光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi za xi no mabu xi sa</span></p><p begin="02:45.600" end="02:49.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">残らず全部欲しい<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">on do mo noko la zu zen bu ho xi yi</span></p><p begin="02:49.110" end="02:52.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">誰か歩いた道にだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁走过的道路 持续的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dale ka alu yi ta miqi ni da ke cuzu yi te ku hikali</span></p><p begin="02:52.830" end="02:55.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">続いてく光</p><p begin="02:55.290" end="03:05.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">硝子に反射して降り注ぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">透过玻璃反射而下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gala su ni han xia xi te fu li soso gu</span></p><p begin="03:35.010" end="03:38.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">答えを出したその先に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当得出答案之后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kota e o da xi ta so no saki ni</span></p><p begin="03:38.610" end="03:43.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">どんな未来が続いても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管未来将如何</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na mi lai ga cuzu yi te mo</span></p><p begin="03:43.270" end="03:45.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">好きだと言いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也想说喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki da to yi yi ta yi</span></p><p begin="03:45.890" end="03:49.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">君に好きと言いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想对你说我喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi ni su ki to yi yi ta yi</span></p><p begin="03:49.540" end="03:53.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">確かにあった あの夏を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">确实存在过的那个盛夏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">taxi ka ni a ta a no nacu o</span></p><p begin="03:53.260" end="03:55.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">幼い記憶を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把青涩记忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">osana yi ki oku o</span></p><p begin="03:55.780" end="03:59.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">閉じ込め 遠く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">封闭心底 朝远处大海展翅飞去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ji ko me too ku wumi he to to ba so wu</span></p><p begin="03:59.720" end="04:10.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">海へと飛ばそう</p></div></body></tt>